  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cash for Work (CfW) Activities Capital Costs (CDEL)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Cash for Work (CfW) Activities Capital Costs (CDEL) is a component of Promoting Inclusive Markets (PIMS) in Somalia aimed at improving productivity, competitiveness, and long term jobs in six value chains. reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;2,190,083. It works in the following sector(s): Agricultural land resources, Fishery development, Livestock, Agricultural services, Agricultural development, Business policy and administration, Rural development.</narrative>
  </description>
